 negative weight                        | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | centroid 0 has a mean or weight that is not valid.
 negative zero maximum                  | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | minimum or maximum is not valid.
 negative zero mean                     | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | centroid 0 has a mean or weight that is not valid.
 negative zero minimum                  | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | minimum or maximum is not valid.
 reserved byte                          | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | reserved header byte is not zero.
 too long                               | 22P02 | invalid input syntax for type tdigest | The value is longer than any valid tdigest.
